From 070de60d504d7ed738f59880778a88d218e1334e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kuzma30 <kuzemkoa@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 15:49:53 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 19/25] Modeling Algorithms - Reuse a tangent edge as the trace
 of a fillet

A box of 20 with fillets of radius 3 on all edges has a flat top of
14 x 14. With a square hole of 13 x 13 in the top and a fillet of radius
0.5 on the edges of the hole (also a hole of 12 with r = 1, a hole of
10 with r = 2), the new fillets touch the top exactly along its tangent
edges with the fillets of the box. The result had a negative volume.

- ChFi3d_Builder::SplitKPart: the trace on the top runs along the edge
  of the face, so the hatching gives a segment along that edge whose
  ends are the ends of the edge. At the end of the spine, the side of
  the fillet ending on an arc was extended to such an end, as if the
  trace left the face there. A segment along an edge is not used for
  that any more.
- ChFi3d_Builder::ComputeOnce: when the trace of a fillet on a face is
  a whole edge of the face (the traces of the fillets of the hole meet
  at the vertices of the top), the curve of the trace is that edge
  (TopOpeBRepDS_Curve::SetExistingEdge), and the points at its ends are
  the vertices of the edge.
- TopOpeBRepBuild_Builder: a face whose curves are all its own edges,
  kept on their outer side, is covered by the fillets and is consumed.
  The copy of a face with the coincident edges substituted kept the
  orientation of a reversed face for its wires, which reversed them.
- TopOpeBRepBuild_Builder::BuildFaces: the face of a fillet takes an
  existing edge running opposite to its curve in the reversed
  orientation.
- TopOpeBRepDS_BuildTool::PCurve: the pcurve of an existing edge is
  brought to the range of the edge also when it is not reversed.

The top is consumed, the traces of the fillets are the tangent edges of
the top. The three cases are valid with tolerance 1.4e-7 to 2.8e-7, and
the removed volume goes on continuously from the radius just below
(r = 0.999 and 1 with the hole of 12: 10.6627 and 10.6844 mm3).

New DRAW test bugs/modalg_8/fillet_trace_on_tangent_edge and GTest
BRepFilletAPI_MakeFilletTest.FilletTraceOnTangentEdge_CoversFaceExactly.

